// Title: Cloudflared Tunnels Related DNS Requests
// ID: a1d9eec5-33b2-4177-8d24-27fe754d0812
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2023-12-20
// Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.t1071.001, attack.t1572
// Description: Detects DNS requests to Cloudflared tunnels domains.
// Attackers can abuse that feature to establish a reverse shell or persistence on a machine.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((QueryName endswithCIS ".v2.argotunnel.com" OR QueryName endswithCIS "protocol-v2.argotunnel.com" OR QueryName endswithCIS "trycloudflare.com" OR QueryName endswithCIS "update.argotunnel.com"))
